# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Shaded lightcones"
msgstr "Instruções de instalação da versão mais recente de Shaded lightcones"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Instruções de instalação"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Instruções de instalação {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, choose how you’re going to run and install the packages. There are two primary ways to do this:\n"
msgstr "Primeiro, escolha como você vai executar e instalar os pacotes. Há duas formas principais de fazer isso:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 1: Install from PyPI](#option-1)\n"
msgstr "[Opção 1: Instalar pelo PyPI](#option-1)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 2: Install from Source](#option-2)\n"
msgstr "[Opção 2: Instalar a partir do código-fonte](#option-2)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Pré-requisitos {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Primeiro, crie um ambiente mínimo com apenas o Python instalado. Recomendamos usar [ambientes virtuais do Python](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Ative seu novo ambiente.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-1\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 1: Install from PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Opção 1: Instalar pelo PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The most straightforward way to install the `qiskit-addon-slc` package is via `PyPI`.\n"
msgstr "A forma mais direta de instalar o pacote `qiskit-addon-slc` é pelo `PyPI`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-2\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 2: Install from Source {#option-2-install-from-source}"
msgstr "Opção 2: Instalar a partir do código-fonte {#option-2-install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally, install from source.\n"
msgstr "Se você pretende desenvolver no repositório ou executar os notebooks localmente, instale a partir do código-fonte.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If so, the first step is to clone the `qiskit-addon-slc` repository.\n"
msgstr "Se sim, o primeiro passo é clonar o repositório `qiskit-addon-slc`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade `pip` and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "Em seguida, atualize o `pip` e entre no repositório.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-addon-slc` to the virtual environment. Install the notebook dependencies if you plan to run all the visualizations in the notebooks. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "O próximo passo é instalar o `qiskit-addon-slc` no ambiente virtual. Instale as dependências dos notebooks se você pretende executar todas as visualizações nos notebooks. Se você pretende desenvolver no repositório, instale as dependências `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Ajuste as opções abaixo conforme sua necessidade.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs.\n"
msgstr "Se você instalou as dependências dos notebooks, pode começar executando os notebooks na documentação.\n"
